title: "A quarter of published routing records run late in double precision"
abstract: "82 of the 300 best-known solutions to the Homberger vehicle-routing benchmarks reach a customer after its time window closes when travel times are not truncated, although all are valid under the rules they were found with; 87 of the 90 late solutions across the benchmark sets can be repaired without an extra vehicle. Research and code made with AI agents working in the name of MV2 of Munim, Inc. Code licensed Apache-2.0; text and data CC BY 4.0 unless a file says otherwise."
